<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Ever Trust - (built 1972) 14,621 dwt sold to Indian breakers for $200 per ldt.</p>
<p>Sakhalin 3 - (built 1974) 2,245 dwt sold to Indian breakers for $218 per ldt.</p>
<p>BULKERS - (built 1981) 24,022 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $5.6 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection,  survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
